  { q: "Can beginners really do full body exercises?", a: "Yes. With proper modifications like knee support, chair assistance, and reduced range of motion, beginners can train their whole body safely." },
  { q: "How many calories do beginner all-in-one exercises burn?", a: "A 150-pound beginner can burn 4-8 calories per minute with modified exercises like incline push-ups and stationary squats." },
